WEBVTT

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.620
What a relief... You're alive...

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.750
Brother...

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.000
It can't be...

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:43.270
"Abyss"

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.950
Akane-san...

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:03.290
Akane-san is my brother's contractee?

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.790
It can't be! What's the meaning of this, Akane-san?

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.300
Why won't you answer me?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.970
Keita-san...

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:19.050
Reishin, you're manipulating her, aren't you?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.430
What do you plan on doing with the help of Akane-san?!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.310
Do you want the Masagami's power that much?

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:32.150
Everyone who comes to this land seeks the Masagami's power.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.820
Not us!

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.690
We came here to stop you!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.070
It's all the same.

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:41.200
It was the Masagami's power that drew you here.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.620
Shut up and return Akane-san right away!

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.790
Brother, is this what you wanted?

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:53.710
You took Mother and the possessions of our brothers because you wanted the Masagami's power?

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.090
That's right.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:02.890
For that alone... You even got Akane-san involved...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.350
I will never forgive you!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.100
Reishin, we're taking you down!

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:15.980
Synchro!

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.990
A Tera cycle?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.200
I'll end this right away.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.120
Synchro.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:42.300
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:00.530
Kuro!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.540
It's over.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.550
Kuro!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.030
What?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.700
Kuro, are you all right?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.570
Yes.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.040
I see...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.590
This is the power of a Tera cycle?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:02.090
They share Tera and support each other's life.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:07.600
It's actually possible for a contractee to perform such a deep synchro with a Mototsumitama?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:11.560
You're no longer a Sub, are you?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.100
Sub or Root, it doesn't matter!

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:20.230
I've come to destroy the fate controlling our world: The Doppeliner System!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.610
The fate of the world...?

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.530
Destroy the Doppeliner System?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.740
That's right.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:35.000
If the Doppeliner system is a curse the Masagami cast upon the humans, then we shall destroy that curse!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.500
You say some amusing things...

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.380
However, that's an impossible wish.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:45.880
I'll crush that hope of yours with this bare fist.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.680
We won't lose!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:52.390
With our combined power, we will definitely defeat you.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.580
Keita-san!

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.160
I'm counting on you.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:16.920
Okay.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.560
It's still deepening...

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:35.180
Who would have thought a contractee and a Mototsumitama could come this far.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:42.570
Once before, there was a time when both humans and Mototsumitama shared mutual trust.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:48.740
But that was a time where they also shared a great fear and a great enemy.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:55.120
Reishin, what are you trying to become?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.800
Kuro!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.970
Exceed...

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.970
From this close?

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.060
...Megaexe!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:22.940
You did it!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.450
Keita-san.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.240
Leave it to me!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.000
This is too easy!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.130
Keita-san!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.840
Go!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.260
Thousands?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:55.640
Now!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.350
Exceed...

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.810
...Gigaexe!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.050
This is it.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.110
Damn it! He's really strong...

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:53.280
It's all right. My brother definitely took some damage.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.030
At this rate, we will win.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.960
You used the Thousands as a distraction...

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.380
Let's go!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.010
All right!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.260
Exceed...

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.100
...Gigaexe!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.110
That does it!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.370
You're making your move?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.130
Their synchro is deeper than ever before.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.630
Why?

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:56.760
Could it be...?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.390
It can't...

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.690
Why?

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.610
Why Akane-san?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.740
To drive the world to its destruction.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:19.490
Pay close attention to my partner's Tera.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.040
Akane-san and Reishin? But why?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.580
Why Akane-san?

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.350
It's different from before...

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.350
This huge power...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.470
Kuro!

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.810
What's wrong, Yakumo?

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.310
Are you feeling okay?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.860
It might have begun...

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.230
The Princess and Reishin-sama's battle.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.610
Really?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:43.450
I was thinking they were taking too long... but leaving us behind and going after Reishin...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.740
That's really cold of them...

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:50.120
I can feel their huge Tera clashing.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:54.130
It's possible Reishin-sama has a contractee...

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.670
They're both willing to die for their beliefs...

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.390
The siblings both...

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.890
That's just...

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:08.270
If only I were more powerful...

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:14.940
Then maybe there would be no need for them to fight.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.980
Yakumo...

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.780
I'm useless.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:28.910
Riona-san...

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:34.670
Yakumo, you can't help it right now.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.550
Don't blame yourself too much.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.220
I'm sorry. Did it hurt?

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.220
No, it's not your fault.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.850
Namu-san's treatment has eased it a...

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.850
Yakumo? Are you all right, Yakumo?

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.450
You still intend to fight?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.210
Of course...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.170
I've...

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:18.840
I've come this far to defeat you, Brother...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.090
Very well...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.360
He's fast!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.780
Go!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.740
Keita-san, thank you!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:51.750
He's coming!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:09.300
You have to leave the Sacred Precincts.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.100
Akane-san!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:15.890
What lies ahead of this is no place for the two of you.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.440
What do you mean?

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:23.190
She means it's no place for you who won't receive the Masagami's power.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.700
It's just as Reishin says.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.320
Reishin, you say... What are you going about?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.530
Weren't you being manipulated by Reishin?

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.580
No...

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.210
This is my will.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.210
Akane-san...

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.710
My brother's Tera is increasing tremendously.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:47.340
Can you feel it? It's from my contractee.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.840
It's Sano Akane's overwhelming Tera.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.970
She is the one and only Master Root.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:14:01.730
The one whose enormous Tera can bend the fate of the Earth and surpass the limits of a human being.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:04.980
Akane-san...? It can't be...

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:09.110
Even if it's the two of you, there's no way you can defeat us.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.370
Akane-san.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:14.870
Don't tell me...

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:18.580
Reishin, you were using that Kaionji girl?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.840
You were aiming for Akane-san from the very beginning, weren't you?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:27.050
What's the meaning of this, Akane-san? Answer me!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.890
Akane-san...

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:32.470
Keita-san.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.470
We have no choice but to fight.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.770
If we defeat my brother, Akane-san will surely come to her senses.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.770
Reishin, we're taking you down!

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.240
To destroy this world's cursed destiny

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:51.740
and to take back Akane-san with these very hands!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:59.710
The amount of Tera alone does not determine the outcome of a match!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.300
She's fast...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:13.760
The deeper the synchro is, the more you can raise your power.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:19.600
I can feel our synchro deepening to its very limit...

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.270
But the Tera flowing from Kuro...

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.570
It's the same as when she fought that Tenma guy...

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.780
It feels eerie...

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.290
Exceed, Gigaexe!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.560
Is this Kuro's power?

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.730
No, it's different.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:09.400
This increase in Tera is about to surpass the limits of a Mototsumitama.

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.320
What Kuro is releasing is not a normal kind of Tera.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.200
What could it be?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.950
Is there some kind of Tera flowing in the Sacred Precincts?

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.960
I've got it, Kuro...

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.710
The reason behind your strength.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.720
What are you talking about?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.350
This power... Reishin...

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.230
I'll settle this with one strike.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.110
Kuro, I'll defeat you.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.120
You'll be the loser!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:03.250
I don't know why but... with our current power...

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:05.500
We can defeat Reishin!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.130
Set free thy will...

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:24.310
And thou shalt see thy true form...

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:30.690
I see it!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.530
Exceed...

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.110
...Gigaexe!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.090
It's over.

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.140
Kuro!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:16.900
Exceed, Senjinshihou!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.130
Kuro!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.620
Kuro...

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:23.260
Those who cycle their Tera probably can't dissolve their contract.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:30.810
Partners who truly resonate are to share each other's destiny.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:36.070
Should a Mototsumitama die, so will the contractee...

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.250
Akane-san...

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.290
Why?

00:19:59.670 --> 00:19:59.760
This is the first frame of the ED

